  "description": "Built for riders who demand more power and premium components, the ZEAL XT8 steps up your ride with a robust 750W motor (peak 1200W) and 85Nm of torque—perfect for steep hills, quicker launches, and heavier loads.\nIts 48V 15Ah LG battery delivers extended range—up to 80 miles on assist or 50 miles throttle-only—so you can go further without range anxiety.\nThe upgraded Shimano 8-speed drivetrain, enhanced TEKTRO brakes, and lockable front suspension give you control and confidence across varied terrain. The full-color 3.5” TFT display provides clear visibility in all conditions, while turn signals and bright lighting keep you safe during night rides or traffic.\nWith thoughtful upgrades across performance and comfort, the XT8 is made for commuters, adventurers, and anyone ready to level up their ride.",
